  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25453b9857303c51e3d279b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟桐生院训练员受秋川理事长所托，\n决定参加活动来提升\n“URA总决赛”的知名度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f42fe516f825545788f7ba16ea532610b777bf4aa0c81ccb26216f960c2f78e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9cb3c1033d53cd4e7b8a66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着事态发展，演变成要我们代替赛马娘\n站上舞台跳舞的状况──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3fcc6df2fd5c5385ab97e5147cd9e03a552bad28a40eca68a1c3524ff24f4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cbd93f889477d7af667330c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论如何，总算是为了提升知名度\n而尽了一己之力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf74df3e3978c5658bfe28264d6038f06d3d7644a59c2bc2685e4c165d54c30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc2ddb3d391992fe27366ba1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "举办活动吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2926b90fad337b0389d57dabdcc83b89e2d76b0d817235d3805749466a887e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6edeed17a3374f57889cf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "桐生院训练员和快乐米可之间\n散发出不太平静的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d591d0af6a7af06dd47ec0d6e4687bfd2c29449321aa6006ce1ae5fe21ff2764",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d1fa1ff5a9d9efef191a39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为同样以夺冠为目标的人，\n我无法置之不理──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b2db82f5c9f442005cd29d59ff5cdd93c3924490b4863fc11913865b0870fe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c579b4728020af7651cdcd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我为她们的和解尽了一份力，\n见证了或许会成为对手的\n她们的成长轨迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "182bbc2ad1bb0413ffaeeaa7435828f995550f23d611a5051050442262d6c036",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ef7a13e60af77b6b298f6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是桐生院训练员为了表示谢意，\n送给我记录了赛马娘培育精髓的\n秘传书──《训练员心得集锦》。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2aa3eea253cfd30a4135d4e2d44b7d3c7ced155affaf25cd92b9b0cf87ee11b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811156d27acb065fc3cef45b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得了‘<itemname>’。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e72d40c21a0a3ec4b940184e4188d579976f1c35d8cbf79a934e3ae065781d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e6f6ff7602100296ecf1bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "桐生院家的训练员心得集锦当中\n所记载的赛马娘培育精髓，\n对<chrname>的成长提供了极大贡献！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2615ef1d1567ef53151e96709503163e4e714cc849f44f7f5b78eefa1806143",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21108e6fc8a56bb7de7b6e3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我为她们的和解尽了一份力，\n见证了或许会成为对手的\n她们的成长轨迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "182bbc2ad1bb0413ffaeeaa7435828f995550f23d611a5051050442262d6c036",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d592d1bda1fd44e63b08d809",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人三脚",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f5706c81873ae53dcca5a795b4b34e847a3e05fc71a1559d070f8e4e03039c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5ca861a269e604c9009329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着期待举办的声浪提高，\n声势也渐渐高涨的URA总决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75df3e7e9e0b0682c77b77051d60edfc659d07bc896aba70cc8a02ef9ef69d6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a603e71af9396eb1e3be330",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<chrname>的支持度还不是很高，\n得更加努力才行──",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d825d888ce90795acafc53fe5fc9ef1a613dfa6216ea1b4b8e69e27431ca07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335d792491ccf12b2d927b5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<chrname>的粉丝人数也顺利增加，\n离“巨星赛马娘”更近一步──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b7c0c9bc95f5ce95a7c55431a6916bc5b1a9b58981f3218442d2177c4d75ca2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56ba7156192d96305376f26f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<chrname>也以压倒性的魅力\n吸引了人们的心──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8685530efab2750bcef6f88ac26e5e97a49be01c85b78fd6a484092d08ef3d2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:254129810045447ce96d49e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "加上先前大幅成长的桐生院训练员\n与快乐米可，众人都重新打起精神，\n一起迎向即将举办的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb36bc274690ea454621ac26e09587dfa6f22863ba842f569a54fda706c08a71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577f0ed5fedb5543373d2e3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在胡萝卜大菜园里",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a56662f8e021e0eb7c0c58f97ec2a8831e7d0668a4c8f7f7336d6b7b828f589",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:157979ef444073891b65cbbf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本期待会盛大成功的URA总决赛，\n此时却发生了一个重大危机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1f6f895a0f8040ec7876437a1e76227ea701a5d1dcd3a11c4432ef15a9511d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4da293f0f34da07f8b0aa7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于连日的暴风雨，\n为了竞赛特地种植的草皮已呈毁损状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df89dd88336ef23979d215786b217f93ed55aef166392e9ed52255c1665ea5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc495c3c49f81148eb88de1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在危及竞赛正常举办的情况下，\n秋川理事长为了解决问题而独自奔走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca2b79b0ebfd3dca7bd0b186bb26d0de30ffadb278c700aa1436a72a448069f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c11a21a2ff45bb1ae6c3f82b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然非常乐意协助秋川理事长，\n但该如何突破现状──\n这让我跟手纲一起伤透了脑筋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bd169c5636d66564a2853300ae7fdfc3368072e2075d505774d6f360a52350",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c498b04c77a5395f95cb8664",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "URA总决赛的举办危机！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2252c34283eb81da2cfb0b84c85fa51925a8966aeff08713015f4d093107da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa808a5ac74fdc07158ef549",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天夜里，我发现秋川理事长在自费的\n农地上种植竞赛草地要用的草。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8563aa2bdb6cce71d3cec9e9b68593ce11cf3ee569e340b93ed5abdd7462e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd696a477d626fd402e8e6ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要靠一己之力产出竞赛草地用的草，\n这想法或许是痴人说梦──\n但只要大家同心协力，应该就能办得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fe408750957525791feb4410de589eeb18d14180e77acd467dacbea39f12cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46b67f80fd39bfae1f6024c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "众粉丝、众赛马娘、众训练员……\n许多人聚集起来，为竞赛的举办贡献心力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7654419a0ff23f7af01ee26ed5292a51aa9075da19d94a4a94f02cbff0630add",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f53c0c2d13096f67fdef7cde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这毫无疑问是秋川理事长她\n对赛马娘的心意所引发的奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1dd8391bbaa51dfb4d965f640ff01cdcf54c7f94249490593adef1a117cd206",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada86da2d4fdc399dc4acf71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "携手共进",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d765a5c7fca525c58944d89148083eeb095d60e4a841efb82775a188ecc921",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0001/storytimeline_400001409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
